        "summary.json: CI overall AE=1.0143, indicating offsetting deviations rather than a uniform level shift"
      ],
      "recommended_action": "Investigate CI data/reporting completeness and timing for 2017-2019, and whether 2020-2024 excess is catch-up or genuine incidence/mix change. Reconcile to ci_claims.csv and benchmarks, check system migrations/coding/product changes, and only revise CI assumptions after normalizing for possible data timing. Death/TPD/IP by-year and IP termination by diagnosis appear consistent with noise."
    }
  ]
}

